              "id": "d2-01-01",
              "type": "blank",
              "question": "碎片显示两个角分别为 50°、30°，原三角形是（　）角三角形。",
              "knowledgePointIds": [
                "kp-d2"
              ],
              "metadata": {
                "difficulty": "基础",
                "order": 1
              },
              "answer": "钝",
              "explanation": "第三角 = 180°−50°−30° = 100° > 90°，是钝角三角形。"
            },
            {
              "id": "d2-01-02",
              "type": "blank",
              "question": "碎片显示两个角分别为 36°、54°，原三角形是（　）角三角形。",
              "knowledgePointIds": [
                "kp-d2"
              ],
              "metadata": {
                "difficulty": "基础",
                "order": 2
              },
              "answer": "直",
              "explanation": "第三角 = 180°−36°−54° = 90°，是直角三角形。"
            },
            {
              "id": "d2-01-03",
              "type": "blank",
              "question": "碎片显示两个角分别为 60°、65°，原三角形是（　）角三角形。",
              "knowledgePointIds": [
                "kp-d2"
              ],
              "metadata": {
                "difficulty": "基础",
                "order": 3
              },
              "answer": "锐",
              "explanation": "第三角 = 180°−60°−65° = 55°，三角均 < 90°，是锐角三角形。"
            },
            {
              "id": "d2-01-04",
              "type": "blank",
              "question": "踏步高度 17.5 cm，踏步宽度比高度至少多 8.5 cm，每级台阶侧面至少要贴（　）cm² 的瓷砖。",
              "knowledgePointIds": [
                "kp-d2"
              ],
              "metadata": {
                "difficulty": "基础",
                "order": 4
              },
              "answer": "455",
              "explanation": "宽 = 17.5+8.5 = 26 cm；侧面积 = 17.5×26 = 455 cm²。"
            },
            {
              "id": "d2-01-05a",
              "type": "blank",
              "question": "等腰三角形一个内角是 40°，若 40° 是顶角，则每个底角是（　）°。",
              "knowledgePointIds": [
                "kp-d2"
              ],
              "metadata": {
                "difficulty": "基础",
                "order": 5
              },
              "answer": "70",
              "explanation": "(180°−40°)÷2 = 70°。"
            },
            {
              "id": "d2-01-05b",
              "type": "blank",
              "question": "等腰三角形一个内角是 40°，若 40° 是底角，则顶角是（　）°。",
              "knowledgePointIds": [
                "kp-d2"
              ],
              "metadata": {
                "difficulty": "基础",
                "order": 6
              },
              "answer": "100",
              "explanation": "180°−40°−40° = 100°。"
            },
            {
              "id": "d2-01-06",
              "type": "blank",
              "question": "等腰三角形两条边分别长 7 cm 和 15 cm，这个等腰三角形的周长是（　）cm。",
              "knowledgePointIds": [
                "kp-d2"
              ],
              "metadata": {
                "difficulty": "基础",
                "order": 7
              },
              "answer": "37",
              "explanation": "7+7<15 不能成三角形；只能是 15、15、7，周长 15+15+7=37。"
            },
            {
              "id": "d2-01-07",
              "type": "blank",
              "question": "天平左盘 2 个圆柱木块 = 右盘 42.8 g 盐。若左盘再放 4 个同样的圆柱木块，右盘需再增加（　）g 盐才平衡。",
              "knowledgePointIds": [
                "kp-d2"
              ],
              "metadata": {
                "difficulty": "基础",
                "order": 8
              },
              "answer": "85.6",
              "explanation": "1 个木块 = 21.4 g；4 个 = 4×21.4 = 85.6 g。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
